{"id":"cfad5734457defe6","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-apriori.md","title":"Machine Output Probability and Discrete A Priori Probability","display":"df-apriori — Machine Output Probability and Discrete A Priori Probability","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-apriori","aliases":["43-df-apriori"],"display":"df-apriori — Machine Output Probability and Discrete A Priori Probability","depends_on":["[[43-df-universal-prefix-machine]]","[[43-df-discrete-semimeasure]]"],"source_book":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","source_version":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"Definition 6.9.3 and Theorem 6.9.4","source_printed_pages":"106–107","source_pdf_pages":"126–127","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","source_statement_checked":false,"source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-apriori"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-apriori</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-apriori — Machine Output Probability and Discrete A Priori Probability"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f5078ab697e20add\" href=\"?note=f5078ab697e20add\" title=\"43-df-universal-prefix-machine\">43-df-universal-prefix-machine</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2352967b8ac4bcf4\" href=\"?note=2352967b8ac4bcf4\" title=\"43-df-discrete-semimeasure\">43-df-discrete-semimeasure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book","html":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"source_version","html":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Definition 6.9.3 and Theorem 6.9.4"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"106–107"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"126–127"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,U:\\Sigma^*\\rightharpoonup\\Sigma^*\">\\(M,U:\\Sigma^*\\rightharpoonup\\Sigma^*\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrefixFreeMachine}(M)\">\\(\\mathrm{PrefixFreeMachine}(M)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UniversalPF}(U)\">\\(\\mathrm{UniversalPF}(U)\\)</span>；机器谓词见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f5078ab697e20add\" href=\"?note=f5078ab697e20add\" title=\"43-df-universal-prefix-machine\">43-df-universal-prefix-machine</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^*\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^*\\)</span>；以下定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf m_M,\\mathbf m_U:\\Sigma^*\\to[0,1]\">\\(\\mathbf m_M,\\mathbf m_U:\\Sigma^*\\to[0,1]\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf m_M(\\sigma)\\coloneqq\\sum_{p\\in\\{q\\in\\operatorname{dom}M:M(q)=\\sigma\\}}2^{-|p|},\\qquad\\mathbf m_U(\\sigma)\\coloneqq\\sum_{p\\in\\{q\\in\\operatorname{dom}U:U(q)=\\sigma\\}}2^{-|p|}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf m_M(\\sigma)\\coloneqq\\sum_{p\\in\\{q\\in\\operatorname{dom}M:M(q)=\\sigma\\}}2^{-|p|},\\qquad\\mathbf m_U(\\sigma)\\coloneqq\\sum_{p\\in\\{q\\in\\operatorname{dom}U:U(q)=\\sigma\\}}2^{-|p|}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对每个前缀机器先定义输出半测度；通用机器对应离散先验半测度。每个程序只为其唯一输出贡献一次质量。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 2007-07-28 草稿，Definition 6.9.3 and Theorem 6.9.4；印刷页 106–107，PDF 页 126–127。来源定位沿用附件；此次修订核查形式化与内部一致性，未重新核对原书 PDF。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-universal-prefix-machine","status":"resolved","id":"f5078ab697e20add","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-universal-prefix-machine]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-discrete-semimeasure","status":"resolved","id":"2352967b8ac4bcf4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-discrete-semimeasure]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-universal-prefix-machine","status":"resolved","id":"f5078ab697e20add","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M,U:\\Sigma^*\\rightharpoonup\\Sigma^*$，$\\mathrm{PrefixFreeMachine}(M)$，$\\mathrm{UniversalPF}(U)$；机器谓词见 [[43-df-universal-prefix-machine]]。$\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^*$；以下定义 $\\mathbf m_M,\\mathbf m_U:\\Sigma^*\\to[0,1]$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"M,U:\\Sigma^*\\rightharpoonup\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrefixFreeMachine}(M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UniversalPF}(U)","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf m_M,\\mathbf m_U:\\Sigma^*\\to[0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf m_M(\\sigma)\\coloneqq\\sum_{p\\in\\{q\\in\\operatorname{dom}M:M(q)=\\sigma\\}}2^{-|p|},\\qquad\\mathbf m_U(\\sigma)\\coloneqq\\sum_{p\\in\\{q\\in\\operatorname{dom}U:U(q)=\\sigma\\}}2^{-|p|}.","display":true}],"bytes":1588,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-97","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-apriori]] — Machine Output Probability and Discrete A Priori Probability"},{"id":"4432074d06eed551","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$U$ 满足 $\\mathrm{UniversalPF}(U)$，$\\mathbf m_U$ 与相应谓词见 [[43-df-apriori]]、[[43-df-discrete-semimeasure]]。"},{"id":"395bd59d8e3d72f2","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$U$ 满足 $\\mathrm{UniversalPF}(U)$；$K$ 是固定前缀复杂度，不要求由同一个 $U$ 定义；$\\mathbf m_U$ 见 [[43-df-apriori]]。"}],"outgoing":["f5078ab697e20add","2352967b8ac4bcf4"]}